  characterName: Savant
  lines:
  - Hello, my dear friend
  - I haven't seen you before. It's seems to me, I shall tell you light guide about
    that place
  - That's shelter where we are now. You could open the door and try take arena.
    But be sure that you will not die there.
  - Enemies are on arena. There a lot of different powerful enemies, which could
    kill you. Sharp your sword and try kill them as many as possible.
